WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.820
[gentle music]

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.760
Get involved and shape the future.

3
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.050
In conclusion of this training series on
chiplets, you now know that the chiplet

4
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:13.380
revolution is here, and the Open Compute
Project invites you to be part of it.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.980
Whether you're a semiconductor company,
a system integrator, or a researcher,

6
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.800
your contributions can shape
the future of chiplet innovation.

7
00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:29.250
OCP's Open Chiplet Economy is a project
within the OCP community, bringing

8
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:34.340
together work streams with hundreds of
participants across diverse organizations.

9
00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.910
Together, the project group is
building a collaborative ecosystem

10
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:42.630
to accelerate the adoption of chiplets,
enabling companies to design

11
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.820
and deploy modular silicon
solutions faster than ever before.

12
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.150
The work streams of the Open
Chiplet Economy project

13
00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.260
are subject to change from time to time.

14
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.630
Today, the work streams can be grouped
into three broad categories focused on

15
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:02.340
open interfaces, chiplet design tools,
and the economy enablement at large.

16
00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.860
By joining the OCP community's efforts,

17
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.600
you gain access to cutting-edge
research, a network of industry experts,

18
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.760
and the ability to influence
the future of chiplet design.

19
00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:19.110
Engagement in OCP ranges from casual
participation in mailing lists and project

20
00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:23.780
calls to authoring and reviewing
of contributions like specifications.

21
00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:27.290
Some people may also take on
leadership roles in shaping

22
00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.540
work streams or the project overall.

23
00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:33.440
Whether you want to stay informed
or drive major initiatives,

24
00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:37.000
there is a place for everyone
in this growing ecosystem.

25
00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.380
Let's build the future together.

26
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:44.160
Get involved, collaborate, and make
an impact in the world of chiplets.

27
00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:49.580
[gentle music]

